<title>IRAQ: SOCCER-KAZAKHASTAN BEAT IRAQ 2-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-KAZAKHASTAN BEAT IRAQ 2-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>BAGHDAD 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhastan beat Iraq 2-1 (halftime 1-1) in a World Cup soccer Asian zone group 9 match on Friday.   Standings   P  W  D  L  F  A  PTS</p>
<p> Kazakhstan   2  2  0  0  5  1  6</p>
<p> Iraq	   2  1  0  1  7  4  3</p>
<p> Pakistan     2  0  0  2  2  9  0</p>
</text>
